\par
Related to this is the demonstrated `value-added' of logistics to emergency
\par
response and disaster management. According to a senior WFP
\par
representative, US government agencies recognize the desirability and
\par
benefit of the LC and have been highly supportive of its work, in large part
\par
because measurements of effectiveness are relatively easy to identify and
\par
