\par
In contrast, the US favours the kind of demonstrated effectiveness that
\par
perhaps is more measurable in some clusters, such as the LC.
\par
Our analysis in this chapter hints that the CA is a step in the right
\par
direction in humanitarian response. Moreover, there are important areas of
\par
alignment with US foreign assistance and disaster management frameworks.
\par
Clearly the model is a work in progress and needs further refinement.
\par
However, it does improve the collection, processing and dissemination of
\par
information through generating clear lines of accountability and reporting,
\par
and pooling resources. The fact that there is a LC alone shows that the
\par
humanitarian aid industry is starting to recognize the critical role logistics
\par
plays in coordinating an effective response -- by extension and in theory, the
\par
value of information in humanitarian response should also be enhanced.
