accounting, there have also been instances in which audit
\par
regulation and state oversight has been strongly influenced,
\par
if not captured, by the private interests of large accounting
\par
firms. Two such instances in the United States are the lobby-
\par
ing of Congress by the large accounting firms through their
\par
Political Action Committees that led to the Private Securities
\par
