\par
International Accreditation Forum, Inc., which accredits certification bodies
\par
to assure the competence and impartiality of certification bodies. Its
\par
website lists membership by 84 accreditation bodies. In education we are
\par
all familiar with bodies that accredit universities in general and business
\par
and accounting programs in particular such as AACSB International, which
\par
is another instance of global standardization.
\par
