years to do so. In the short term, the most useful step would be
\par
to initiate ``horizon scanning'' for new procedures or step
\par
changes in existing procedures that would have potentially
\par
a high-cost or high-volume impact and conduct economic
\par
evaluations of these relative to current imaging practice, to
\par
establish the incremental economic value of the innovation
\par
