\par
To represent uncertainty through time in relation to management
\par
actions using models consistent with experience to lead to
\par
improved productivity;
\par
To design balanced policies that provide for continuing resource
\par
production whilst increasing understanding - e.g. use of decision
\par
tables or matrices.
\par
