Abstract
\par
This working paper provides an annotated bibliography of studies on Building Information
\par
Modelling (BIM), which were published in English in the first six months of 2012. It discusses
\par
the areas of focus in this international research and how the work relates to and informs
\par
changes in policy and practice. The paper is writte i the cotext of the UK BIM task groups
\par
ambition to implement BIM in public procurement by 2016. The aim is not to provide a
\par
comprehensive review, but rather starting points for discussion about the related research
\par
challenges, contributions to practice, and future research opportunities.
