Recommendation for
\par
Executive Action
\par
To promote transparency and help strengthen SEC's procedures for
\par
documenting events related to potential current and post-employment
\par
issues associated with the movement of employees between SEC and
\par
other employers, we recommend that the SEC Chairman establish
