\par
\textbf{Political Appointees and the Stock Market}
\par
Simon Luechinger a), b) and Christoph Moser b), c) 
\par
a) University of Lucerne,
\par
b) ETH Zurich, KOF Swiss Economic Institute
\par
c) CESifo
