\par
4seen as close to the new U.S. Treasury Secretary, Timothy Geithner, upon his appointment
\par
amidst the Subprime Crisis in November 2008. Acemoglu et al. (2010) measure connections
\par
to Geithner in three ways -- two related to his former position as head of the New York
