Hospital-based HTA
\par
In Canada, hospitals are funded under
\par
a global budget designated by provincial
\par
governments. Yet, within their global
\par
budget, individual hospitals make the
\par
decision on which techno\- logies to pur-
\par
chase or services to provide at their hospi-
\par
tals. However, hospital decision makers are
\par
also facing difficult choices on how best
\par
to allocate limited healthcare resources
\par
within their fixed budget. Under such
