\par
Fuzzy sets are used for addressing uncertainties derived from
\par
fuzziness or vagueness of input parameters in subsurface model-
\par
ing. These inputs can be received in terms of linguistic judgments,
\par
which can then be converted to the form of fuzzy sets [33]. The
\par
general notation of fuzzy sets can be presented as follows [34]:
\par
