\par
degrees. For the same technology, a two-well implementation plan
\par
would perform better than a single-well one. For example, in terms
\par
of pump-and-treat operations, the highest benzene concentration
\par
obtained from one-well operations would be 2.332 mg/L; it would
\par
decrease to 0.288 mg/L when two wells are in operation. In addition,
\par
it appears that bioremediation is cheaper than pump-and-treat.
\par
