\textbf{Prioritization of water management under climate change}
\par
\textbf{and urbanization using multi-criteria decision making methods}
\par
\textbf{J.-S. Yang}1\textbf{, E.-S. Chung}2\textbf{, S.-U. Kim}3\textbf{, and T.-W. Kim}4
\par
1School of Civil and Environmental Engineering, Kookmin University, 136-702 Seoul, Republic of Korea
