\par
where w+ is the sum of the weights of all criteria where A
\par
is better than B; w- is the opposite case, i.e., the sum of the
\par
weights of the criteria where B is better than A; and w= is
\par
the indifferent cases. D(A, B) can be calculated as shown in
\par
Eq. (4).
