to improve the clarity and understandability. The final items and their sources are
\par
listed in the Appendix. All items were measured with a seven-point Likert scale
\par
ranging from strongly disagree (1) to strongly agree (7).
\par
Items of information quality and system quality were adapted from Kim et al.
\par
(2004). Items of information quality reflect information relevancy, sufficiency, accuracy
