\par
tem. The reader will gain an understanding of the dynamic forces that are
\par
slowing the adoption of POC technology. Also, the reader is provided with
\par
the authors' future perspectives for POC testing in emergency medicine. The
\par
current healthcare system is putting a lot of pressure on EDs to be able to pro-
\par
vide efficient care using advanced diagnostic tests. Clinicians and administra-
\par
tors alike must understand the gaps between the clinician's perceived benefit
\par
